  "description": "Bubbloony is a fun and vibrant bubble font perfect for adding a playful touch to your creative projects. Inspired by joy and imagination, this font features rounded, bubbly characters that bring a pop of personality to designs like posters, invitations, social media graphics, logos, and merchandise.\nThis font comes in two styles – Regular and Outline – giving you the flexibility to explore various design options. Its colorful and whimsical design makes it ideal for children’s themes, creative branding, and more.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bubbloony is a fun and vibrant bubble font perfect for adding a playful touch to your creative projects. Inspired by joy and imagination, this font features rounded, bubbly characters that bring a pop of personality to designs like posters, invitations, social media graphics, logos, and merchandise.</p>\n<p>This font comes in two styles – Regular and Outline – giving you the flexibility to explore various design options. Its colorful and whimsical design makes it ideal for children’s themes, creative branding, and more.</p>",
